# OS specific

# TaskMaster's own state, which lives at .taskmaster/tasks/tasks.json.
tasks.json
tasks/

# ...but the `tasks` translation namespace happens to share that filename, and
# this pattern matches at every depth. What stood here was a negation listed per
# locale, seven of the ten — so ko, zh-CN and zh-TW had their tasks.json
# silently ignored. zh-TW's was translated in full and never committed: anyone
# cloning the repo got the entire TaskMaster UI in English for that locale, with
# nothing anywhere reporting a problem. One glob over the tree instead of a list
# to keep in sync, so adding a locale cannot reintroduce this.
!src/i18n/locales/*/tasks.json

